Hey all, thanks a lot for all the feedback here. We'll be trying to make this much clearer and easier to use for you all. Apologies for any issues you're currently facing. 

In the meantime, I'll try and help address the comments here one by one:

@bradleyjames - currently, environment variable expansion is only available by `.mcp.json` (in your project), although I will let you know if this changes promptly for user and local variable expansion. All user and local settings are stored within you
